#: ../../download.md:1
msgid "Get Cadrumo"
msgstr "Obtén Cadrumo"

#: ../../download.md:3
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This page covers how to install the current Cadrumo beta: the supported "
"install paths, what each one gives you, and how to confirm the install "
"before you prepare your first declaration. Cadrumo runs on Windows, "
"macOS, and Linux."
msgstr ""
"Esta página cubre las formas de conseguir Cadrumo en tu máquina: qué hay "
"disponible hoy, cómo instalarlo y cómo confirmar que la instalación "
"funciona antes de preparar tu primera declaración. Cadrumo funciona en "
"Windows, macOS y Linux."

#: ../../download.md:8
msgid ""
"Cadrumo is in beta. Every release ships installable packages for each "
"supported channel, and every package is install-tested on its platform "
"before the release is cut. The beta is distributed through the project's "
"GitHub repository; public registry listings open with the public launch."
msgstr ""

#: ../../download.md:14
msgid "What you need"
msgstr "Qué necesitas"

#: ../../download.md:16
msgid "Python 3.13 or newer."
msgstr "Python 3.13 o posterior."

#: ../../download.md:17
msgid ""
"[Git](https://git-scm.com/downloads) and [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv"
"/getting-started/installation/), each installed per its official guide "
"for your operating system."
msgstr ""
"[Git](https://git-scm.com/downloads) y [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv"
"/getting-started/installation/), cada uno instalado según su guía oficial"
" para tu sistema operativo."

#: ../../download.md:19
msgid "Around 200 MB of free disk space."
msgstr "Alrededor de 200 MB de espacio libre en disco."

#: ../../download.md:20
msgid ""
"Access to the [project repository](https://github.com/nevenincs/cadrumo) "
"as a beta participant."
msgstr ""

#: ../../download.md:23
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"No taxpayer data, AEAT credentials, or online account is involved in the "
"install. Cadrumo stores everything locally and encrypted; nothing about "
"your taxes leaves your machine."
msgstr ""
"No hace falta ningún dato del contribuyente, credenciales de la AEAT ni "
"cuenta en línea para instalar. Cadrumo lo guarda todo de forma local y "
"cifrada; nada sobre tus impuestos sale de tu máquina durante la "
"instalación."

#: ../../download.md:27
#, fuzzy
msgid "Install the current beta"
msgstr "Instala desde la copia del código fuente"

#: ../../download.md:29
msgid ""
"Install from the repository checkout. The flow is identical on Windows, "
"macOS, and Linux:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../download.md:38
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`uv sync` creates an isolated environment and installs the `aeat` command"
" into it with every dependency pinned to the tested versions. Nothing is "
"installed globally and nothing outside the checkout directory is "
"modified: removing the directory removes Cadrumo. To move to a newer beta"
" release later, run `git pull` followed by `uv sync` in the same "
"directory."
msgstr ""
"`uv sync` crea un entorno aislado e instala en él el comando `aeat` con "
"todas las dependencias básicas fijadas. No se instala nada de forma "
"global y no se modifica nada fuera del directorio de la copia: eliminar "
"el directorio elimina Cadrumo."

#: ../../download.md:44
msgid ""
"Release artifacts for the current version, including the packaged builds "
"for every channel below, are attached to the [latest "
"release](https://github.com/nevenincs/cadrumo/releases/latest)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../download.md:48
msgid "Confirm the install"
msgstr "Confirma la instalación"

#: ../../download.md:50
msgid "Run the version check from the checkout:"
msgstr "Ejecuta la comprobación de versión desde la copia:"

#: ../../download.md:56
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A version number confirms the install. Then run the full workstation "
"check and add the optional extras you want (Google export, the live AEAT "
"browser, OFX/QFX import, the agent surface) by following [Install Cadrumo"
"](workstation-setup.md), which covers the dependency report, platform "
"checks, and per-extra install commands. To let an AI assistant such as "
"Claude drive Cadrumo, continue with [Connect an agent (MCP)](how-to"
"/connect-an-agent.md)."
msgstr ""
"Un número de versión significa que la instalación funcionó. Después "
"ejecuta la comprobación completa de la estación de trabajo y añade los "
"extras opcionales que quieras (exportación a Google, el navegador en vivo"
" de la AEAT, la importación OFX/QFX, la superficie de agente) siguiendo "
"[Instalar Cadrumo](workstation-setup.md), que cubre el informe de "
"dependencias, las comprobaciones de plataforma y los comandos de "
"instalación de cada extra."

#: ../../download.md:64
#, fuzzy
msgid "Install channels"
msgstr "Canales de distribución"

#: ../../download.md:66
msgid ""
"Each release builds and install-tests a native package per channel. Beta "
"participants get every artifact from the release page; the registry "
"listing for each channel opens with the public launch, and this page "
"carries each channel's install command from that day."
msgstr ""

